<div class="page-heading"><div class="section-overline">A LITTLE CONVERSATION</div><h1>A connection starts here</h1><p>Ask a question, confirm a pickup, say hello to your campus neighbour.</p></div><div class="messages-layout"><section class="surface"><h2>Your conversations</h2><% if(!inbox.length){ %><p class="quiet-note">No messages yet. Open a product to contact its seller.</p><% } %><div class="message-list"><% for(const message of inbox){ const other=message.sender_id===user.id?message.recipient_id:message.sender_id; %><article class="message-entry"><div><strong><%= message.sender_id===user.id?'You':message.sender_name %></strong><small><%= message.title %></small></div><p><%= message.body %></p><a href="/messages?product=<%= message.product_id %>&with=<%= other %>">Reply ↗</a></article><% } %></div></section><section class="surface"><% if(product && recipient){ %><h2>A message for <%= recipient.name %></h2><p>About <strong><%= product.title %></strong></p><form action="/messages" method="post"><%- include('../partials/csrf') %><input type="hidden" name="product_id" value="<%= product.id %>"><input type="hidden" name="recipient_id" value="<%= recipient.id %>"><label>Your message<textarea name="body" rows="6" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><button type="submit" class="primary-button">Send message ↗</button></form><% }else{ %><h2>Your next connection</h2><p>Pick a conversation, or find something you love and message its seller.</p><a class="secondary-button" href="/products">Find my thing ↗</a><% } %><p class="quiet-note">Meet in a public campus location. Keep payment and pickup arrangements clear.</p></section></div>
